          </summary>
          <p class="px-6 pb-5 text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Absolutely. You do not need special software to create a legally valid invoice, as long as it contains all the necessary information. However, using online invoice generators makes the process much faster and more professional.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center px-6 py-4 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-slate-900 list-none">
            What happens if I make a mistake on an invoice?
