          </summary>
          <p class="px-6 pb-5 text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">If you notice an error before payment, notify the client immediately, void the incorrect invoice, and issue a new one with a revised invoice number. Do not just alter the old one, as this creates accounting discrepancies.</p>
        </details>
